      "common:generalComment": [
        {
          "#text": "Gaseous natural gas supplied through a pipeline, with1m3 volume reference. Reference temperature, pressure, gas composition, calorific value and density must be stated by the Process and matched by the provider. This Flow does not impose an actual-pressure or normal-volume convention and contains no universal mass-to-volume ratio. A normal cubic metre recorded by a Process means one cubic metre at its explicitly declared normal conditions. Compliance with a named gas standard requires independent source evidence. Overall compliance has not been independently certified.",
          "@xml:lang": "en"
        },
        {
          "#text": "经管道供给的气态天然气，参考量为1m3体积。参考温度、压力、组分、热值和密度须由过程说明，并与供应过程匹配。本流不统一规定实际压力体积或标准体积，不设置通用质量体积比。过程中的标准立方米指其明确声明的标准条件下的一立方米；符合具体燃气标准须另有来源证明。 整体合规性尚未经独立认证。",
